  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>----- 项目已迁移 -----</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-souls-like-universe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-souls-like-universe</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>------------------------------------------------</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>这是一个非常简单的模组，为《我的世界》添加了“被选中的不死者”护甲。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/475/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"493\" height=\"486\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>护甲属性</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>头盔: 3</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>胸甲: 7</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>护腿: 6</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>靴子: 2</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/478/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"145\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/479/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"137\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/481/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"142\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/482/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"140\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>还有...</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本模组也兼容 Epic Fight Mod！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/476/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"572\" height=\"535\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/773/477/2023-12-13_02.png\" width=\"572\" height=\"564\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>答：当然可以！非常感谢！！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>+非常感谢大家对本模组的喜爱与关注。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>未来我会更加努力的。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
